cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use gwsource, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "gwsource: cell-mixing flow tracing for MODFLOW 6"
abstract: >-
  gwsource post-processes MODFLOW 6 groundwater-flow output. For every cell it computes the
  fraction and volume of water that reaches chosen destinations (capture) or came from chosen
  sources (fate), under full mixing, by solving the trace as one sparse system of linear
  equations. It handles steady and transient flow, every MODFLOW 6 grid type, multi-model
  simulations and advanced-package networks, and computes Eulerian mean travel times.
